{"t":"Dragon Slayer Outfits","s":"dragon-slayer-outfits-6ca10","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Dragon_Slayer_Outfits_Artwork_9be0bb.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Dragon Slayer Outfits</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Official Artwork\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"301\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dragon_Slayer_Outfits_Artwork_9be0bb.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"pi-item-spacing pi-caption\">Official Artwork</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"primarytype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quest Outfits</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"outfit\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Outfit</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">See <a href=\"#/quest/dragon-slayer-outfits-quest\">Dragon Slayer Outfits Quest</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"addons\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Addons</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">See <a href=\"#/quest/dragon-slayer-outfits-quest\">Dragon Slayer Outfits Quest</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"achievement\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Achievement</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p class=\"no-results\">No achievement</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">12.31.9658<br/>April 09, 2020<br/>Tournament Triumph Preparation</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See Also: Outfits, Outfiter <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-outfit-images\" style=\"font-size:small;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Images\">Images</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Outfit</th>\n<th>Addon 1</th>\n<th>Addon 2</th>\n<th>Addons 1+2\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Male\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Dragon Slayer Male\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Dragon_Slayer_Male_aa13b4.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Dragon Slayer Male Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Dragon_Slayer_Male_Addon_1_9d4e30.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Dragon Slayer Male Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Dragon_Slayer_Male_Addon_2_950de9.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Dragon Slayer Male Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Dragon_Slayer_Male_Addon_3_28a15c.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Female\n</th>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Dragon Slayer Female\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Dragon_Slayer_Female_59f355.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Dragon Slayer Female Addon 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Dragon_Slayer_Female_Addon_1_594c10.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Dragon Slayer Female Addon 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Dragon_Slayer_Female_Addon_2_30a2d1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Outfit Dragon Slayer Female Addon 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Outfit_Dragon_Slayer_Female_Addon_3_3ed2a1.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-outfit-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>The souls of countless slain dragons have been fused over the years with this armour, wrought from the impervious scales of the ancestors of those very same beings, wicked and wise, winged and wild. The Dragon Slayer Outfit has seen an unfathomable amount of bloodshed, but it pales in comparison to the untold lives lost in the strife over the armour itself. Only the mightiest warriors can even begin to dream of ever owning this exceedingly rare token of power.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-outfit-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Originally, it could be acquired for 5000 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Tournament Coins\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"12\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tournament_Coin_687384.png\" width=\"11\"/></span></span> if you placed in the top 3 of a Tournament, and it would grant access to all characters on the account.</li>\n<li>Since the Sunsetting of Tournaments it became temporarily unavailable from March 17, 2023 up until the update which was released on October 10th, 2023. Since then it has been reintroduced into the game through the addition of <a href=\"#/quest/nimmersatts-lair\">Nimmersatt's Lair</a>, as was previously mentioned would be done in the news here.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Outfits\">Related Outfits</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Quest_Outfits\">Quest Outfits</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Afflicted%20Outfits\">Afflicted Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Aucar%20Outfits\">Ancient Aucar Outfits</a></li><li>Assassin Outfits</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Battle%20Mage%20Outfits\">Battle Mage Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Beggar%20Outfits\">Beggar Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brotherhood%20Outfits\">Brotherhood Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Captains%20Outfits\">Captains Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cave%20Explorer%20Outfits\">Cave Explorer Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Citizen%20of%20Issavi%20Outfits\">Citizen of Issavi Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Warlord%20Outfits\">Crystal Warlord Outfits</a></li><li>Decaying Defender Outfits</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Deepling%20Outfits\">Deepling Outfits</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Hunter%20Outfits\">D